What does this C code print?

```c
int x = 5, y = 2;
x = x + y;
y = x - y;
printf("%d %d", x, y);
```

What does this C code print?

```c
int s = 0;
for (int i = 1; i <= 4; i++)
    s = s + i * i;
printf("%d", s);
```

What does this C code print?

```c
int f(int n) { return n * 2 + 1; }

int main() {
    printf("%d", f(f(2)));
    return 0;
}
```

How many times does `c++` run? The program prints the final value of c.

```c
int c = 0;
for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++)
    for (int j = i; j < 4; j++)
        c++;
printf("%d", c);
```
